{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1177633-comedic-inspiration-erma","id":1177633,"title":"Comedic Inspiration: Erma","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-20T10:40:32-08:00","id":1177633,"title":"Comedic Inspiration: Erma","content":"Who is the titular protagonist of a <a href=\"https://tapas.io/episode/255222\" target=\"_blank\">very funny webcomic</a> about a shy, kind, and somewhat mischievous girl who takes after her mother's Japanese side of the family.<br /> <br /> Specifically, the fact her mother is an unbelievably powerful <i>onryo </i>and Erma herself seems to be packing even more uncontrollable nercomantic power (and hair, but that's normal).<br /> <br /> Besides being hilarious, I thought it might be good inspiration for how CofD society actually functions when it's not lying to itself about supernature, as well as for a Horror or Geist game (and of course, mages are going to be all over how, exactly, a <i>ghost </i>got pregnant and carried to term).<br /> <br /> EDIT: Just a warning, that site doesn't do so hot with mobile platforms, especially phones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 01-20-2018, 01:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-20T17:43:10-08:00","id":1177734,"title":"","content":"AHAHAHAHA, this is hilarious. Thanks for sharing.<br /> <br /> Rules-wise, the mother is probably a Materialized ghost. Erma is... well, she's frighteningly powerful, by the looks of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-06T04:01:11-08:00","id":1192193,"title":"","content":"Ah, I love that series. My favourite is the part where her classmates bug her for answers and get into an argument over it, so she unleashes an unholy screeching. Most of the class is like &quot;Holy shit, that was scary!&quot; and the boy goes &quot;Alright, the answer is Skree!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T06:48:04-07:00","id":1197960,"title":"","content":"I've always looked at Erma and her family as what happens when you handle an encounter with the supernatural in a mature and kind manner, empathizing instead of trying to flee/destroy the troubled spirit.<br /> <br /> Even terrible ghosts of murder and destruction need a hug sometimes....<br /> <br /> Oh, and yes, the rest of the comic is a good example of how the rest of the world handles supernatural encounters. Extreme terror, minor planning, but otherwise an intent to go on about their lives as if the person is &quot;normal&quot;.<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}